{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDefaultAdvertViewController"],"title":"Localizing the Advertisement Label","anchor":"Localizing-the-Advertisement-Label"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt reader asks the app for a banner to show below the pages,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and for a view controller for each advert page. In your own reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"screen, banners are yours to build, but advert pages need little work:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" renders them itself, with the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built-in rendering, and its advert delegate can replace any of them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Using the prebuilt UI? See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When your editions carry adverts, your reader screen usually needs two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"things. First, the app configuration, passed when the reader opens an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edition, so third-party adverts can serve and in-article adverts appear:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Hosting-the-Reader#Passing-the-App-Configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" adds an "},{"code":"appConfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property to ","type":"text"},{"code":"ReaderScreenViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the reader screen from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Hosting-the-Reader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", and passes it to the reader. Second, a view","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"controller for Google Ad Manager and Freestar pages, which have no built-in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendering. In ","type":"text"},{"code":"hostReader()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with the other delegates, make the screen the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader’s advert delegate:"}]},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"code":["reader.advertDelegate = self"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And conform in an extension, in the same file as the class:"}]},{"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"showLineNumbers":false,"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[],"code":["extension ReaderScreenViewController: PSEditionReaderViewController.AdvertDelegate {","","    func advertViewController(forPage page: PSEPage) -> PSEAdvertContentViewController? {","        guard page.advertProvider == .googleAdManager else {","            return nil   \/\/ The built-in rendering.","        }","        return GoogleAdPageViewController(page: page)","    }","","    func canRenderAdvertPage(_ page: PSEPage) -> Bool {","        page.advertProvider == .googleAdManager","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GoogleAdPageViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" is your advert page view controller, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Rendering-Advert-Pages-Yourself","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method claims the pages it serves: the reader leaves out any page without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built-in rendering that the delegate doesn’t claim, so set the delegate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the edition opens (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Pages-the-Reader-Leaves-Out","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). A page for a custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider, Freestar for example ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEAdvertProvider\/custom(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), needs a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view controller of its own in the same way, built from the page’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage\/thirdPartyAdvertConfig","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". In Swift 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language mode, mark the conformance "},{"code":"@preconcurrency","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Hosting-the-Reader#Swift-6-Language-Mode","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Giving-Third-Party-Adverts-an-Origin","text":"Giving Third-Party Adverts an Origin","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The built-in rendering serves third-party adverts in a web view, which","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"needs a web origin to load against, usually your publication’s website.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The reader takes it from your media delegate’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController\/MediaDelegate-swift.protocol\/baseURL(for:)","isActive":true},{"text":" when that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns one, and otherwise from your app configuration’s advertising","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"domain, then its edition base URL. Third-party adverts also prefer the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configuration’s ad-stack scripts to the page’s own copy. With neither a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"base URL from your media delegate nor an app configuration, third-party"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adverts have no origin and can’t serve.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app configuration also switches on the in-article adverts it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configures, which templated pages render within their content (see"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Adverts-Inside-Pages"},{"text":"). To load it and pass it to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader, see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Hosting-the-Reader#Passing-the-App-Configuration"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Serving Advert Pages From Your Ad Stack","anchor":"Serving-Advert-Pages-From-Your-Ad-Stack"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reader asks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController\/AdvertDelegate-swift.protocol\/advertViewController(forPage:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for every ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert_html"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert_third_party"},{"type":"text","text":" page. Return a view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controller that adopts "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEAdvertContentViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pins its view to the page’s edges; return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to keep the built-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering for a page. To render nothing, return an empty view controller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert_pdf"},{"type":"text","text":" pages render as PDF or web content and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"never reach the delegate."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the delegate before the edition opens, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hostReader()"},{"type":"text","text":" does, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first pages use it. Everything else works as it does in the prebuilt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The reader builds pages before they’re on screen and rebuilds them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later, and asks your delegate each time, so return a new view controller","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from every call.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Request ads and count impressions from the reader’s visibility hooks,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never ","type":"text"},{"code":"viewDidAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Rendering-Advert-Pages-Yourself","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"explains each hook, with a Google Ad Manager view controller to start","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Full-Page-Advert-Pages"},{"type":"text","text":" lists what the built-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering shows for each provider."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A classic PDF edition’s page-zero advert reaches your delegate too, for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slot beside the cover; see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Adverts-Beside-the-Cover","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Localizing the Advertisement Label","level":2,"anchor":"Localizing-the-Advertisement-Label","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The built-in rendering shows a label above fixed-size third-party slots."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The reader always labels them “Advertisement”, in English. To show your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own text, create the default renderer yourself, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDefaultAdvertViewController"},{"type":"text","text":". Replace the delegate method with:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"code":["func advertViewController(forPage page: PSEPage) -> PSEAdvertContentViewController? {","    if page.advertProvider == .googleAdManager {","        return GoogleAdPageViewController(page: page)","    }","    return PSEDefaultAdvertViewController(","        page: page,","        application: appConfig,","        baseURL: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\",","        advertisementLabelText: String(localized: \"Advertisement\")","    )","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the app configuration you open the edition with, and the base URL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the advert content loads against, usually your publication’s website. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" for pages it can’t render, such as Google Ad","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Manager and Freestar pages; with nothing from your delegate either, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader leaves those pages out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Placing-a-Banner","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Placing a Banner"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reader has no banner slot. A banner is part of your chrome: lay it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out below the reader, as the prebuilt reader screen does, by pinning the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader’s bottom edge to the banner’s top in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hostReader()"},{"type":"text","text":" instead of to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the safe area. Add a property that remembers the page the banner last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"targeted:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"lineAnnotations":[],"code":["private var bannerPageGUID: String?"],"wrap":0},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updateChrome()"},{"type":"text","text":", refresh the banner when the reader settles on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new page:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"lineAnnotations":[],"code":["if page.pageguid != bannerPageGUID {","    bannerPageGUID = page.pageguid","    bannerAd.refresh(section: page.section)","}"],"wrap":0},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"bannerAd"},{"type":"text","text":" is your banner view. The check skips a settle on the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page, which the reader reports when the user drags and lets go without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turning the page."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Handling Clickthroughs and Analytics","type":"heading","anchor":"Handling-Clickthroughs-and-Analytics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The built-in rendering doesn’t navigate an advert’s web view when the user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"taps it. Clickthroughs, including ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"window.open"},{"text":" calls, post","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController\/linkTappedNotification","isActive":true},{"text":", and open only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once your reader screen observes it, as it does for every other link; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps#Opening-Links","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt reader reports an advert page that settles on screen as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page view. Its analytics events don’t fire in your reader screen;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Reporting-Analytics#Reporting-Page-Views","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reports page views and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says how to decide whether advert pages count. Count impressions in your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own advert view controllers."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Custom-UI"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/handling-advert-pages"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/handling-advert-pages"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Handling-Advert-Pages"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Guide","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Handling Advert Pages","modules":[{"name":"PSReader"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let the reader in your own reader screen render advert pages, or serve them from your own ad stack, and place any banners in your chrome."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Download-Button","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Share-Button","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Building-a-Search-Screen","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Listen-Button","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-Comment-Buttons","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Gating-Editions-Behind-a-Paywall","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Reporting-Analytics"],"generated":true,"title":"Adding Features","anchor":"Adding-Features"}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Advertisements":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/advertisements","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Advertisements","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Show banner adverts in the prebuilt reader, and serve its advert pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from your own ad stack."}]},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Building-a-Search-Screen":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build your own search screen that searches your publications’ editions with the SDK’s search service and opens results in your own reader screen."}],"type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Building-a-Search-Screen","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/building-a-search-screen","title":"Building a Search Screen","kind":"article"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/handling-media-and-link-taps","abstract":[{"text":"Respond to taps on the images, videos, embeds, hotspots, and links in the pages your own reader screen hosts.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"Handling Media and Link Taps","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/PSEDefaultAdvertViewController":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEDefaultAdvertViewController","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PSEDefaultAdvertViewController","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PSEDefaultAdvertViewController","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PSEDefaultAdvertViewController","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/psedefaultadvertviewcontroller","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The framework’s default, webview-only renderer for advert pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert_html"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"advert_third_party"},{"type":"text","text":"). No third-party native SDKs are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"involved — third-party ad tech (htlbid\/aditude) runs inside the webview"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via the PageSuite hosted loader. Google Ad Manager pages, and pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for providers the framework doesn’t know, have no framework default:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clients supply a native advert through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PSEditionReaderViewController.AdvertDelegate.advertViewController(forPage:)"},{"type":"text","text":". This class is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"public so overriding delegates can still fall back to it selectively."}]},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps#Opening-Links":{"url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/handling-media-and-link-taps#Opening-Links","title":"Opening Links","type":"topic","kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Handling-Media-and-Link-Taps#Opening-Links","abstract":[]},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/AdvertDelegate":{"url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/advertdelegate","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AdvertDelegate"}],"title":"AdvertDelegate","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AdvertDelegate"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/AdvertDelegate","abstract":[{"text":"A delegate protocol to enable custom advertising placements within the SDK.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/PSEditionReaderViewController":{"url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/pseditionreaderviewcontroller","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEditionReaderViewController","title":"PSEditionReaderViewController","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A view controller that presents an edition from PageSuite’s current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system, classic PDF or responsive, as a horizontally paged reader."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PSEditionReaderViewController","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PSEditionReaderViewController"}]},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","title":"PSReader","url":"\/documentation\/psreader","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed digital newspaper and magazine editions in your iOS app. Use PageSuite’s prebuilt reader, or build your own interface on the same engine."}]},"doc://com.pagesuite.PSReader/documentation/PSReader/Advertisements#Pages-the-Reader-Leaves-Out":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements#Pages-the-Reader-Leaves-Out","title":"Pages the Reader Leaves Out","url":"\/documentation\/psreader\/advertisements#Pages-the-Reader-Leaves-Out","abstract":[],"kind